' ============================== DOMAIN AGGREGATE ==============================

class ScheduledJob {
    - _currentExecutionRunId: Optional<Guid>
    + Name: string
    + TaskType: ScheduledTaskType
    + Schedule: Schedule
    + Status: ScheduledJobStatus
    + OwnerUserId: UserId
    + LastStartedOnUtc: Optional<DateTime>
    + LastCompletedOnUtc: Optional<DateTime>
    + {static} Create(name: string, taskType: ScheduledTaskType, schedule: Schedule, ownerUserId: UserId): Result<ScheduledJob>
    + Add(): Result<Success>
    + StartCycle(): Result<Success>
    + StopCycle(): Result<Success>
    + Fire(): Result<Success>
    + Remove(): Result<Success>
    + MarkExecutionStarted(isCycleRun: bool): Result<Success>
    + MarkExecutionCompleted(isCycleRun: bool): Result<Success>
}

note right of ScheduledJob
  Aggregate root of the scheduling bounded context. Drives the
  life cycle of a scheduled job and of each execution of its task
  through domain events. The private _currentExecutionRunId tracks
  the run of the task currently executing, so that only the worker
  that marked the run as started can complete it.
end note

