note bottom of ScheduledJobExecutionStartedDomainEventHandler
  Updates the scheduled job to Running, inserts the open execution
  history row, and notifies the SignalR clients about the started
  execution.
end note

note bottom of ScheduledJobExecutionCompletedDomainEventHandler
  Returns the scheduled job to Active after a cycle run, or completes
  it after a one time execution, closes the execution history row,
  and notifies the SignalR clients about the completed execution.
end note

' ============================== INFRASTRUCTURE - SCHEDULER ==============================

class ScheduledJobSchedulerJob {
    - _serviceScopeFactory: IServiceScopeFactory
    - _runtimeRegistry: IScheduledJobRuntimeRegistry
    - _logger: ILogger
    + StartCycleAsync(scheduledJobId: ScheduledJobId, token: CancellationToken): Task
    + StopCycleAsync(scheduledJobId: ScheduledJobId, token: CancellationToken): Task
    + RunOnceAsync(scheduledJobId: ScheduledJobId, token: CancellationToken): Task
    + ExecuteAsync(stoppingToken: CancellationToken): Task
    - ResumeActiveCyclesAsync(token: CancellationToken): Task
    - RunCycleWorkerAsync(scheduledJobId: ScheduledJobId, runImmediately: bool, stoppingToken: CancellationToken): Task
    - RunScheduledJobAsync(scheduledJobId: ScheduledJobId, isCycleRun: bool, token: CancellationToken): Task
    - ExecuteScheduledJobRunAsync(scheduledJobId: ScheduledJobId, isCycleRun: bool, token: CancellationToken): Task
}

note right of ScheduledJobSchedulerJob
  Background service (registered as IScheduledJobScheduler and hosted)
  that resumes the active execution cycles at startup, runs each cycle
  worker on its schedule through PeriodicTimer, guards each execution
  against overlapping runs, and publishes the started and completed
  domain events of every run through the EventualConsistencyMiddleware.
end note

interface IScheduledJobRuntimeRegistry {
    + TryStartCycle(scheduledJobId: ScheduledJobId, cycleCancellationTokenSource: CancellationTokenSource): bool
    + StopCycle(scheduledJobId: ScheduledJobId)
    + TryAcquireRunSlot(scheduledJobId: ScheduledJobId): bool
    + ReleaseRunSlot(scheduledJobId: ScheduledJobId)
}

class ScheduledJobRuntimeRegistry {
    - _runtimeStates: ConcurrentDictionary<ScheduledJobId, ScheduledJobRuntimeState>
}

note right of ScheduledJobRuntimeRegistry
  Holds the live runtime state of the scheduled jobs in memory: one
  cancellation token source per execution cycle and one run slot per
  scheduled job, so no two executions of the same task overlap.
end note

