    + LastCompletedOnUtc: DateTime?
}

class ScheduledJobExecutionEntity {
    + Id: Guid
    + ScheduledJobId: Guid
    + TaskType: ScheduledTaskType
    + IsCycleRun: bool
    + StartedOnUtc: DateTime
    + CompletedOnUtc: DateTime?
}

note bottom of ScheduledJobEntity
  Stored in the ScheduledJobs table, whose enums are persisted as
  strings and which is indexed by status so the scheduler can quickly
  find the active and running cycles at startup.
end note

note bottom of ScheduledJobExecutionEntity
  Stored in the ScheduledJobExecutions table, indexed by the started
  time and the scheduled job id for fast history queries and cleanup.
end note

